# --- Reports policy -------------------------------------------------------
# reports/ has two tiers:
#   tier 1 (tracked)   : report chinh (.md), bang tong hop, run_metadata.json,
#                        registry.json, MANIFEST.json
#   tier 2 (ignored)   : output tho, checkpoint, snapshot, archive do may sinh,
#                        co the tao lai tu tier 1 + lenh trong report
# Giu file cua tier 2 tren may de resume/tra cuu, nhung khong commit vao git.
reports/**/raw/*
!reports/**/raw/README.md
reports/**/raw_results/
reports/**/checkpoints/
reports/**/snapshots/
reports/**/archive/
